# Security + performance headers (Netlify/Cloudflare-Pages `_headers` format).
# For Apache/Nginx hosts, translate equivalently (see docs/seo-decisions.md).
# STAGING/PREVIEW deploys must ALSO send `X-Robots-Tag: noindex` (via the host's
# deploy-context config, NOT this file) plus build with PUBLIC_INDEXING=staging.
# Production deploys MUST NOT send X-Robots-Tag.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
